package home

templ gamestate() {
	<div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-md">
    <input type="checkbox" checked />
    <div class="collapse-title text-xl font-medium text-primary">
        SDK Game State Reference
    </div>
    <div class="collapse-content overflow-x-auto">
        <div class="prose max-w-none pt-4">
            <p>Every game tick, the SDK invokes your bot with a <code>GameState</code> object and a set of useful <code>GameHelpers</code>. Below is a conceptual JSON representation of the <code>GameState</code> that your bot evaluates.</p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-6">

                <!-- Left Column: The JSON Code Block -->
                <div class="not-prose relative group">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2 px-1">
                        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase opacity-50 font-mono">Example Game State (JSON)</span>
                        <button onclick="copyCode('json-state', this)" class="btn btn-xs btn-ghost opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">Copy JSON</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mockup-code bg-neutral text-neutral-content text-sm" id="json-state">
                        <pre data-prefix="1"><code>&lbrace;</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="2"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"currentTick"</span>: <span class="text-warning">42</span>,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="3"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"me"</span>: &lbrace;</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="4"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"id"</span>: <span class="text-success">"bda20cd7-..."</span>,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="5"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"pos"</span>: &lbrace; <span class="text-secondary">"x"</span>: <span class="text-warning">1</span>, <span class="text-secondary">"y"</span>: <span class="text-warning">1</span> &rbrace;,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="6"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"health"</span>: <span class="text-warning">3</span>,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="7"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"score"</span>: <span class="text-warning">0</span></code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="8"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&rbrace;,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="9"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"opponents"</span>: [</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="10"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lbrace;</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="11"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"id"</span>: <span class="text-success">"c7e41f9a-..."</span>,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="12"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"pos"</span>: &lbrace; <span class="text-secondary">"x"</span>: <span class="text-warning">9</span>, <span class="text-secondary">"y"</span>: <span class="text-warning">9</span> &rbrace;,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="13"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"health"</span>: <span class="text-warning">3</span>,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="14"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"score"</span>: <span class="text-warning">10</span></code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="15"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&rbrace;</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="16"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;],</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="17"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"players"</span>: [ <span class="opacity-50">/* me + opponents */</span> ],</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="18"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"field"</span>: &lbrace;</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="19"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"width"</span>: <span class="text-warning">11</span>,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="20"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"height"</span>: <span class="text-warning">11</span></code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="21"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&rbrace;,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="22"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"bombs"</span>: [</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="23"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lbrace;</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="24"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"pos"</span>: &lbrace; <span class="text-secondary">"x"</span>: <span class="text-warning">4</span>, <span class="text-secondary">"y"</span>: <span class="text-warning">3</span> &rbrace;,</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="25"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"fuse"</span>: <span class="text-warning">5</span></code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="26"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&rbrace;</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="27"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;],</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="28"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="text-secondary">"explosions"</span>: [</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="29"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lbrace; <span class="text-secondary">"x"</span>: <span class="text-warning">2</span>, <span class="text-secondary">"y"</span>: <span class="text-warning">5</span> &rbrace;</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="30"><code>&nbsp;&nbsp;]</code></pre>
                        <pre data-prefix="31"><code>&rbrace;</code></pre>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Right Column: Explanations -->
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="border-l-4 border-secondary pl-4">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-secondary">Players</h4>
                        <p class="text-sm">
                            <code>me</code> contains your bot's status (ID, position, health, and score).
                            <code>opponents</code> lists the other active bots.
                            <code>players</code> is a combined list of all alive entities.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border-l-4 border-secondary pl-4">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-secondary">The Field</h4>
                        <p class="text-sm">
                            The map uses a 2D coordinate system where <code>(0,0)</code> is the top-left corner. The map consists of indestructible <strong>WALLs</strong>, destructible <strong>BOXes</strong>, and walkable <strong>AIR</strong>. You can evaluate cells using <code>helpers.is_walkable(pos)</code>.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border-l-4 border-warning pl-4">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-warning">Bombs & Chain Reactions</h4>
                        <p class="text-sm">Active bombs have a <code>fuse</code> that ticks down to 0. Each explosion extends 2 tiles from the center, destroying a single box in its path while being blocked by walls. Explosions trigger chain reactions by detonating other bombs in their range.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="border-l-4 border-error pl-4">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-error">Explosions</h4>
                        <p class="text-sm">Danger zones! These coordinates indicate active fire. Any bot present at these coordinates during the current tick loses health. Explosions dissipate after exactly one tick.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
}
